{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_frncat_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_frncat_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"小點心","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_frncat_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"bb4917c156a8a10a0aa25cbed80fdeca668882949c015d93c1323c9a342817fd","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"慕斯精心佈置，準備迎接前來羅德島探望自己的媽媽，卻從開始就出現了小小的意外......","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑紋“貓貓”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗚——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等哦，貓貓，今天也不能陪你們玩了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我住的地方，媽咪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己一個人住嗎，小點心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，媽咪，我還有一位舍友，她也住在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......是這樣啊，媽咪都沒有給她準備禮物，來之前沒想到你是與別人合住一個房間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的，媽咪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她有任務需要出外勤，短期內應該是沒法回艦上了。她還說，如果你不介意的話，這幾天可以睡在她的床上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，其實媽咪在接駁的城區裡訂了酒店......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是，酒店裡的陳設肯定比這裡要好，媽咪住在那裡肯定更舒服些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不過嘛，酒店的房間雖然好，但沒有我的小點心陪在身邊，感覺那裡有些空蕩蕩，一個人睡肯定會失眠的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，媽咪決定這幾天都留在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（刮了下慕斯的鼻子）沒錯，小點心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道你要來，我昨天花了一整天做掃除，裡面所有傢俱都被我擦得閃閃亮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小點心，你記得嗎？在家裡，你連床都不用自己鋪的啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島......和家裡不一樣的，很多事情都需要我自己動手，剛開始的確很不習慣，不過後來，我在適應的過程中學到了很多東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前都不知道，那麼大一床被子，要怎麼才能把它塞進被罩裡面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次嘗試的時候，我費了半天勁都不得要領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，我滿頭大汗，終於把拉鍊拉上了，媽咪你猜怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差點把我自己給套進去了，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（尷尬的笑容）媽咪真的是很意外呢......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪，把眼睛閉上好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，媽咪你先把眼睛閉上，就一小會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......好好好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我保證，你看到我的房間一定會大吃一驚的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......小點心，媽咪確實是大吃一驚啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗚，媽咪，不是的不是的，我早上離開時還不是這個樣子的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一片狼藉的房間裡，數隻“貓貓”在裡面竄跑打鬧。\n掛在窗台上的那些一縷一縷的織物，依稀還能看出窗簾的原樣。\n而原本放置在桌面上的那幾隻花瓶就沒有那麼好運了，統統被“貓貓”們掃落，淪為一地碎片。\n一隻“貓貓”在桌子上抬頭俯身，打算跳上旁邊的衣櫃。\n慕斯抬頭看去，有一隻花瓶歪倒在衣櫃頂部，從邊緣處探出半拉來，搖搖欲墜，岌岌可危。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"條紋“貓貓”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（躥上櫃頂）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"條紋“貓貓”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗷嗚——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不要動我的花瓶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"條紋“貓貓”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......壞貓貓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些壞貓貓！真是太過分了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，小點心，這些小淘氣總是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪，對不起，房間裡的這幅景象絕對不是我想要你看到的樣子，我真的有好好收拾一遍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪知道的，小點心，我們先找個地方坐下，一起想想辦法，看怎麼把房間恢復成原來的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看......這裡還有沒有能坐的地方？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪，小心地上的毛線繩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小點心，什麼？！啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪，你還好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒事，小點心......別擔心。就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這就去叫醫療部的幹員來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不不......我沒有受傷，是我剛剛摔倒的時候踩到了裙子。所以我想，不出意外的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"它的後面應該破了一個大洞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......忙了一天好累啊，腰酸背痛，好難受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是慕斯你今天不是休假嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我媽咪要來了，我一直在為此做準備。這幾天一直緊張得要死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"親人來探望不是應該高興才對嗎？慕斯你為什麼會緊張成這個樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......一直很擔心自己會讓媽咪失望，比起優秀的兄弟姐妹，我是家裡最平凡的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅事業上沒有什麼成就，還感染了見不得人的病症......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯你不要這樣妄自菲薄，前幾天博士不是還特地在戰鬥後誇獎你進步飛速嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......可是，這些都遠遠不夠，我的兄弟姐妹實在是太厲害啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布倫年紀輕輕就成了軍隊的中校，艾米麗剛畢業，就在好幾家銀行做顧問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦爾萊著作等身，是源石技藝研究領域的學術權威，還有我最小的弟弟卡爾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，瓦爾萊小姐？是我想的那個瓦爾萊小姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒有錯，她是我的親姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我現在可算明白你為什麼會緊張了，慕斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小時候，只要出席聚會，免不了要被別人和他們做一番比較。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然媽咪一直在人前維護我，但她那麼要強的一個人，一定覺得有我這樣的孩子很丟人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上流社會的家族這點最討厭了，比這比那，到處都是閒言碎語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以這次媽咪來，我得多多向她展示我在這裡的成長啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好......瑟麗斯夫人，我是柏喙，是慕斯的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你好，柏喙小姐，辛苦你幫我補裙子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"真的非常感激，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，能幫上忙我很開心，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙&瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看起來，慕斯的媽媽不是個健談的人呢......慕斯怎麼還不回來，我總不能就這麼一直和她媽媽面對面乾坐著吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可該聊什麼呢？算了，隨便找點話題吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深吸一口氣）瑟麗斯夫人，我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪，我拿來了杏仁蛋糕，是你最喜歡的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（太好了，你終於回來了，慕斯！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙，我也為你做了一份布丁塔，我記得你最愛吃這道甜點了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，慕斯！對了，瑟麗斯夫人的裙子我已經補好了，上身完全沒有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，柏喙小姐真的很厲害呢，那麼大一個破洞經她的手修補過後，一點都看不出來呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，柏喙！以後你要是有什麼想吃的甜點就告訴我，我、我一定給你做出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太誇張了，慕斯。別傻站著了，一起坐下來品嚐吧。我看瑟麗斯夫人也等不及要吃了，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，小點心，媽媽好久都沒吃你做的蛋糕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪，柏喙，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是太美味了，慕斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，無論是蛋糕胚還是奶油都做得恰到好處，嗯......真的是非常非常......呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......我好像吃到一些奇怪的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一撮毛？怎麼會出現在蛋糕裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，是貓貓的毛！媽咪，你不要吃了，我這就去給你換一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，媽咪，是我當時沒有關好廚房的門，才讓貓貓跑了進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......沒有關係的，小點心，媽媽不介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是媽咪你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"真的沒有關係，小點心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可是，媽咪你的眼圈都紅了啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，柏喙小姐，身為設計師，你一定對最近流行的款式頗為瞭解吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"因為莊園裡的裁縫風格守舊，我不喜歡，所以一直想要訂購幾套新式的裙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"所以問問你們年輕人，都喜歡些什麼樣式的裙子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？哦哦，對，最近兩年流行在裙子上加入針織元素。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"針織元素，我記得十幾年前也流行過一陣子呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，流行就是一個輪迴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉默地扭著手指）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯小姐，菜都上齊了，你和你媽媽試試看，這口味能不能吃慣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（埋頭喝茶）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小點心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，好、好多啊，吽先生，我剛才沒有點這麼多菜啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"島上幹員的親屬都是好不容易來一次，多送你兩個菜，別客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回去忙了，你們慢用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝謝你，吽先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，小點心，剛剛這位廚師先生也是你的朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吽先生手很巧，會做很多炎國的糕點，我時不時會向他學一些技法，來豐富自己的經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"真是難得，以前你在莊園裡，總是孤零零一個人，身邊只有貓貓在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我們又都有自己的事情要忙，唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時，媽咪和爹地已經盡最大的努力保護我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然來到這裡後，我交到了很多朋友，但其實心裡也一直在想念媽咪和爹地。當時收到你要來這裡的消息，我真的非常激動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡工作我沒能賺很多錢，不過這兩年還是存了些積蓄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小點心，這是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在可頌小姐那裡買了一套茶杯，肯定是比不上媽咪在家裡用的，希望媽咪你不要嫌棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（捂住胸口）怎麼會呢，小點心？你送給我的，我怎麼會不喜歡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"看看這精緻的拖盤，真是太漂亮了，我帶回去一定都捨不得用，說不定還要擺在櫃子裡，讓每個人都能看見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪你喜歡就好，之前本來都是想向你好好表現的，可卻在一直出糗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在想之前的事嗎，小點心？媽咪都告訴你了，沒有事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我剛剛都看到......嗯，食堂怎麼進來一隻貓貓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，貓貓在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就、就在媽咪的背後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑紋“貓貓”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗷——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！不要往桌子上跳啊，貓貓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，我的杯子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇——！壞貓貓，你們這些壞貓貓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我討厭你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪好不容易來一次，為什麼你們總是要過來搗亂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我花了好久打掃屋子，存了好久的錢給媽咪買禮物......嗚嗚......你們這些壞貓貓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小點心，別哭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（站起身）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯小姐，怎麼了？我在廚房裡聽到你在哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"avg_388_mint_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯你不要撿地上的碎片了，可能會扎到你，我去拿掃把清理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的沒事的，慕斯，杯子打碎不要緊，如果你需要，我那裡有很多，你可以隨便選一套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗚，怎麼了怎麼了？是誰欺負小慕斯了嗎？別擔心，我會和帽子一起把他狠狠修理一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的......其實都要怪我自己沒有做好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"胡說什麼！不許你這麼說自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（真的是太好了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"再靠過來些，小點心，我幫你把頭髮擦乾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你把頭髮剪短了，媽咪記得你以前非常愛惜自己的長髮呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出任務不方便，做蛋糕也不方便，所以我一狠心就都剪掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......也好，你短頭髮看起來也好看，媽咪也喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，躺上來睡覺吧，小點心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚你真的要和我擠一張床嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，只是擔心你會睡不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次瓦爾萊寫信告訴我，你去看她的時候，一整夜都沒睡踏實......你在她那裡睡的還是五星級酒店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我擠在一起，你真的可以睡好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......不是的，媽咪那天不是因為床不好才失眠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦爾萊那時實驗出了些事故，額頭上留了好大一塊疤，我一看到擔心得要死，當然睡不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，幸好沒什麼大事，第二天，她準時出現在了台上作報告，非常精彩的報告，台下的掌聲好久才停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在台下一定很自豪吧，媽咪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"當然了，瓦爾萊從小就是個優秀的孩子，沒怎麼讓我操過心。不像卡爾那個混小子，上個月胳膊摔斷了還整天笑嘻嘻地跑來跑去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡爾比賽的時候受傷了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，都那樣了還不願意下場換人，硬是要堅持踢完整場比賽，你爹地知道後狠狠地把他臭罵了一頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，是他的球隊贏了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"當然......他和他的隊友是那個年齡段裡最好的一批選手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈——好睏......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（往被子裡縮了縮）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......今天對我失望了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦爾萊和卡爾都是可以讓媽咪自豪的孩子，可我不是......從小，我就沒什麼天賦，也沒什麼特長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在學校，我學習成績也不起眼，染病後，讓媽咪一直為我操心，甚至很長一段時間裡，媽咪不得不拋下自己的工作，陪在我身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，媽咪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直都不能讓你為我驕傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轉頭）媽咪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小點心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摸向床鋪另一邊）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小點心？！奇怪，她去哪裡了？天都還沒亮呢......盥洗室裡也沒人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"條紋“貓貓”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咪嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"貓貓......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小傢伙，你知道我的小點心在哪裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"條紋“貓貓”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（低下頭舔屁股）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不要不理會我啊，貓貓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"條紋“貓貓”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（繼續舔屁股）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，慕斯這一周以來一定忙著準備迎接我的事宜，冷落了你們這些小淘氣，所以你們才會為了吸引她的注意調皮搗蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我代她向你們說聲抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"條紋“貓貓”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸摸“貓貓”的下巴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"還在生氣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"條紋“貓貓”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在願意帶我去找她嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"“貓貓”在瑟麗斯夫人的腳邊輕輕蹭了蹭，然後蹲在門口，示意她跟上自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，已經六點了嗎？不行，還得再快點，得趕在早飯前把麵包烤好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天怎麼就睡過頭了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許是因為睡在媽咪身邊覺得很安心吧......麵團已經準備好，可以製作內餡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿起盆子開始打發奶油）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......啊，手怎麼在這個時候發癢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好難受，好想撓一撓......不行，一撓就沒完沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我來吧，小點心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎麼來了，是我起床的時候吵到你了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小點心，你每天都會起這麼早，為這裡的幹員準備早餐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......這是我唯一擅長的事情，何況，我也很喜歡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在莊園裡，我沒什麼機會做這些，來到這裡後，發現能夠有所施展，感覺心裡很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我的小點心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你做到哪一步了，我來和你一起弄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，媽咪，我一個人能搞定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看，麵團已經發酵好了，內餡就交給我吧，奶油醬可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可以。不過媽咪你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，小點心，這是獨屬於我們母女的時刻，我們可有很長時間都沒有在一起做過麵包了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，媽咪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"內餡就拜託你了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"廚房裡，母女兩人的身影不斷在料理台和烤箱間穿行。\n她們之間幾乎沒有對話，一個輕微的眨眼，一個細微的動作，就已經足夠完成所有的交流。\n羽獸蛋液被打進碗中，淡奶油漸漸充滿氣泡，發酵的麵團被抹上糖漿，預熱好的烤爐冒出絲絲煙氣。\n丁零噹啷，就是廚房裡的頌歌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪，我們成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，小點心，我們成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕在早飯前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，趕在早飯前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許可以再多做一些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在麵包上撒上一層糖霜）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這才是完美的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人&慕斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（對視良久）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我為你自豪，小點心，非常非常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒和你說過，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼呢？媽咪如果自豪，應該是為了布倫、為了艾米麗、為了瓦爾萊、為了卡爾，他們都是優秀的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我......我只是不起眼的慕斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有兩條尾巴，學不懂數學，文法一團糟，還得了礦石病，發病時......手還會變得很難看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"可這些媽咪從來都不在乎啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那媽咪到底在乎我什麼呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，小點心，媽咪只在乎你是不是快樂，是不是做著自己熱愛的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"當時，關於要不要把你送到這裡來，媽咪和爹地吵了很多次架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪不想讓你一個人來到這裡，生活條件比不上家裡不說，如果你出了什麼事，我們中沒有一個人可以及時趕到你身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"來之前，我很忐忑，我想，如果我的小點心在這裡過得不好，就是和你爹地狠狠打一架我也要帶你回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"可你在這裡非常幸福......不再孤零零一個人，有了那麼多關心你的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我還是沒有能夠像瓦爾萊他們一樣好好招待你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"並沒有，小點心，我很滿意啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，昨天從蛋糕裡吃出貓貓的毛時，你都委屈得要落淚了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，小點心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高興......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我很久都沒吃到你做的蛋糕了，自從生病後，你就再也沒有進過廚房了......小點心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛走進廚房時，媽咪還有了更令人驚喜的發現，你不僅重拾了自己的烘焙愛好，你還......還在這裡繼續著自己熱愛的烘焙事業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽咪的這些想法......我從來都不知道......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯，媽咪的小點心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"著急的小幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯姐姐，我今天有早課，麻煩你幫我裝兩個......呃，阿姨你好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你好，小朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是崔斯啊，兩個是嗎......？裝好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"著急的小幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝慕斯姐姐......咦，這個麵包以前沒有吃過，慕斯姐姐，這是什麼種類啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是隨便做的，沒有什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"它是“媽媽的驕傲”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯&著急的小幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟麗斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，這款麵包的名字是“媽媽的驕傲”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["潔西卡"]}]}
